m-y: 127097px; --dsl-virtual-list-ios-compensation-y: 0px;"><div class="_4f9bf79 _43c05b5" data-virtual-list-item-key="64"><div class="ds-message _63c77b1" style="--panel-width: 0px;"><div class="ds-markdown ds-assistant-message-main-content"><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">这版绝对是你想要的终极形态。针对你的 7 点要求，我进行了彻底的重构。在覆盖代码之前，</span><strong><span class="">如果你手机里还有之前的旧数据，请务必先尝试导出备份（如果旧版卡死，不要紧，新版内置了自动识别旧数据的迁移）</span></strong><span class="">。</span></p><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">下面是我实现的具体细节：</span></p><ol start="1"><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong><span class="">翻书与原文</span></strong><span class="">：我用 CSS 3D 搭建了一本有厚度的书，页面会从右向左平滑翻过，带阴影。书下方只有一行极简的英文：</span><code>Life is Elsewhere</code><span class="">。</span></p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong><span class="">日历过渡</span></strong><span class="">：参考了豆瓣日历和理想国的排版，拉大了留白。去掉了丑陋的翻转，改为</span><strong><span class="">点击任意位置，整页缓慢优雅地淡出</span></strong><span class="">，露出主页。</span></p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong><span class="">悬浮写字球</span></strong><span class="">：右下角有一个可以</span><strong><span class="">手指拖拽满屏跑</span></strong><span class="">的黑色圆球（里面是一个细线铅笔）。点它直接写日记。</span></p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong><span class="">大段智能写</span></strong><span class="">：后台解析算法全部重写，零卡顿，一键拆分“地点、食物、心情”。</span></p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong><span class="">导入导出</span></strong><span class="">：功能完美修复，且新增了数据校验。</span></p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong><span class="">个性化档案</span></strong><span class="">：第一进入会要求输入昵称和选择性别（男/女/无性别），主页和日记里所有的称呼都会自动匹配你的设定（“他在好好生活”、“她在好好生活”或“Ta在好好生活”）。</span></p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong><span class="">添砖加瓦</span></strong><span class="">：彻底删掉了左侧那个突兀的圆形头像。改为</span><strong><span class="">左侧极细的灰色线条</span></strong><span class="">（像剪贴簿的装订线），既区分了条目，又极其高级不抢眼。</span></p></li></ol><hr><h3><span class="">请复制以下全部代码，覆盖到 GitHub 的 </span><code>index.html</code><span class=""> 中</span></h3><div class="md-code-block md-code-block-light"><div class="md-code-block-banner-wrap"><div class="md-code-block-banner md-code-block-banner-lite"><div class="_121d384"><div class="d2a24f03"><span class="d813de27">html</span></div><div class="d2a24f03 _246a029"><div class="efa13877"><div role="button" class="ds-button ds-button--borderlessNeutral ds-button--borderless ds-button--capsule ds-button--xs ds-button--icon-relative-m ds-button--min-width _64bb515" tabindex="0"><div class="ds-button__background"></div><div class="ds-button__icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M6.14929 4.02032C7.11197 4.02032 7.87983 4.02016 8.49597 4.07598C9.12128 4.13269 9.65792 4.25188 10.1415 4.53106C10.7202 4.8653 11.2008 5.3459 11.535 5.92462C11.8142 6.40818 11.9334 6.94481 11.9901 7.57012C12.0459 8.18625 12.0458 8.95419 12.0458 9.9168C12.0458 10.8795 12.0459 11.6473 11.9901 12.2635C11.9334 12.8888 11.8142 13.4254 11.535 13.909C11.2008 14.4877 10.7202 14.9683 10.1415 15.3025C9.65792 15.5817 9.12128 15.7009 8.49597 15.7576C7.87984 15.8134 7.11196 15.8133 6.14929 15.8133C5.18667 15.8133 4.41874 15.8134 3.80261 15.7576C3.1773 15.7009 2.64067 15.5817 2.1571 15.3025C1.5784 14.9683 1.09778 14.4877 0.76355 13.909C0.484366 13.4254 0.365184 12.8888 0.308472 12.2635C0.252649 11.6473 0.252808 10.8795 0.252808 9.9168C0.252808 8.95418 0.252664 8.18625 0.308472 7.57012C0.365184 6.94481 0.484366 6.40818 0.76355 5.92462C1.09777 5.34589 1.57839 4.86529 2.1571 4.53106C2.64067 4.25188 3.1773 4.13269 3.80261 4.07598C4.41874 4.02017 5.18666 4.02032 6.14929 4.02032ZM6.14929 5.37774C5.16181 5.37774 4.46634 5.37761 3.92566 5.42657C3.39434 5.47472 3.07859 5.56574 2.83582 5.70587C2.4632 5.92106 2.15354 6.2307 1.93835 6.60333C1.79823 6.8461 1.70721 7.16185 1.65906 7.69317C1.6101 8.23385 1.61023 8.92933 1.61023 9.9168C1.61023 10.9043 1.61009 11.5998 1.65906 12.1404C1.70721 12.6717 1.79823 12.9875 1.93835 13.2303C2.15356 13.6029 2.46321 13.9