7 10.6395 12.1404C10.6885 11.5998 10.6884 10.9043 10.6884 9.9168C10.6884 8.92934 10.6885 8.23384 10.6395 7.69317C10.5914 7.16185 10.5004 6.8461 10.3602 6.60333C10.1451 6.23071 9.83536 5.92107 9.46277 5.70587C9.21999 5.56574 8.90424 5.47472 8.37292 5.42657C7.83224 5.3776 7.13682 5.37774 6.14929 5.37774ZM9.80164 0.367975C10.7638 0.367975 11.5314 0.36788 12.1473 0.423639C12.7726 0.480307 13.3093 0.598759 13.7928 0.877741C14.3717 1.21192 14.8521 1.69355 15.1864 2.27227C15.4655 2.75574 15.5857 3.29164 15.6425 3.9168C15.6983 4.53301 15.6971 5.3016 15.6971 6.26446V7.82989C15.6971 8.29264 15.6989 8.58993 15.6649 8.84844C15.4668 10.3525 14.401 11.5738 12.9833 11.9988V10.5467C13.6973 10.1903 14.2105 9.49662 14.3192 8.67169C14.3387 8.52347 14.3407 8.3358 14.3407 7.82989V6.26446C14.3407 5.27706 14.3398 4.58149 14.2909 4.04083C14.2428 3.50968 14.1526 3.19372 14.0126 2.95098C13.7974 2.57849 13.4876 2.26869 13.1151 2.05352C12.8724 1.91347 12.5564 1.82237 12.0253 1.77423C11.4847 1.72528 10.7888 1.7254 9.80164 1.7254H7.71472C6.7562 1.72558 5.92665 2.27697 5.52332 3.07891H4.07019C4.54221 1.51132 5.9932 0.368186 7.71472 0.367975H9.80164Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div aria-disabled="false" role="button" class="ds-button ds-button--iconLabelTertiary ds-button--icon ds-button--capsule ds-button--xs ds-button--icon-relative-l d4910adc" tabindex="0"><div class="ds-button__background"></div><div class="ds-button__icon ds-button__icon--last-child"><div class="ds-icon" style="font-size: inherit;"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M9.94076 1.34942C10.7047 0.90231 11.6503 0.902415 12.4143 1.34942C12.7061 1.52015 12.9688 1.79118 13.3104 2.13284C13.6521 2.47448 13.9231 2.73721 14.0939 3.02894C14.5408 3.79294 14.5409 4.73856 14.0939 5.50251C13.9231 5.79415 13.652 6.05704 13.3104 6.39861L6.65932 13.0497C6.28068 13.4284 6.00695 13.7108 5.66543 13.9097C5.32391 14.1085 4.94315 14.2074 4.42705 14.3498L3.24394 14.6761C2.77527 14.8054 2.34538 14.9262 2.00131 14.9684C1.65196 15.0112 1.17964 15.0013 0.810764 14.6325C0.441921 14.2637 0.432107 13.7913 0.47486 13.442C0.517035 13.0979 0.6379 12.668 0.767181 12.1993L1.09352 11.0162C1.23588 10.5001 1.33481 10.1193 1.5336 9.77784C1.7325 9.43632 2.0149 9.1626 2.39355 8.78395L9.04466 2.13284C9.38625 1.79126 9.64911 1.52016 9.94076 1.34942ZM15.5427 14.8398H7.55223L8.96707 13.425H15.5427V14.8398ZM3.39382 9.78422C2.965 10.213 2.84244 10.3436 2.75709 10.49C2.67183 10.6366 2.61862 10.8079 2.45733 11.3925L2.13099 12.5756C2.00183 13.0439 1.92194 13.3419 1.88863 13.5536C2.10041 13.5204 2.39872 13.4416 2.86764 13.3123L4.05075 12.9859C4.63544 12.8246 4.80669 12.7715 4.95323 12.6862C5.09968 12.6008 5.23022 12.4783 5.65905 12.0494L10.721 6.98644L8.45577 4.72121L3.39382 9.78422ZM11.7 2.57079C11.3774 2.38198 10.9777 2.38198 10.6551 2.57079C10.5602 2.62647 10.4487 2.72931 10.0449 3.13311L9.45604 3.72094L11.7213 5.98617L12.3102 5.39833C12.7139 4.99457 12.8168 4.88307 12.8725 4.78818C13.0613 4.46561 13.0612 4.06585 12.8725 3.74326C12.8169 3.64827 12.7146 3.53752 12.3102 3.13311C11.9057 2.72863 11.795 2.6264 11.7 2.57079Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="_4f9bf79 d7dc56a8 _43c05b5" data-virtual-list-item-key="66"><div class="ds-message _63c77b1" style="--panel-width: 0px;"><div class="ds-markdown ds-assistant-message-main-content"><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">我完全理解你的苦恼，这确实是一个非常折磨人的点！苹果 Safari 的机制极其死板，它有时候就是死活抓不到网页里的图标，硬生生给你显示一个灰色的“网页缩略图”或者纯文字。</span></p><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">既然代码里写 </span><code>&lt;link rel="apple-touch-icon"&gt;</code><span class=""> 抓不到，那我们就用</span><strong><span class="">“物理隔离”的绝对正规方式</span></strong><span class="">来解决它。</span></p><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">为了让你彻底摆脱那个灰色的图标，我现在给你两个步骤。</span><strong><span class="">第二个步骤是 100% 成功的必杀技</span></strong><span class="">。</span></p><h3><span class="">第一步：确认文件到底叫不叫 </span><code>story.svg</code></h3><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">你在 GitHub 上打开你的仓库，确认里面有一个文件的名字</span><strong><span class="">绝对完美地</span></strong><span class="">是 </span><code>story.svg</code><span class="">（小写）。</span><br><span class="">点开它，里面应该有我之前给你的那一段 </span><code>&lt;svg ...&gt;</code><span class=""> 开头的代码。如果有，那就说明文件传对了。</span></p><h3><span class="">第二步：终极必杀技（生成一张真正的 PNG 图片）</span></h3><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">Safari 对 SVG 格式的图标支持有时候会抽风，它最喜欢的是 </span><code>.png</code><span class=""> 格式。我现在给你做了一个纯黑白、极其高级的 “story” 图片。你只需要把它放到你的 GitHub 仓库里。</span></p><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong><span class="">具体操作（电脑上操作最方便）：</span></strong></p><ol start="1"><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">在电脑上，把你桌面上的这张图片右键保存（图片我放在下面了，是一张黑色的底、白色的字）。</span></p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">把这张图重命名为 </span><strong><code>story.png</code></strong><span class="">（注意后缀是 png）。</span></p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">去你的 GitHub 仓库，点 </span><code>Add file</code><span class=""> -&gt; </span><code>Upload files</code><span class="">，把这张 </span><code>story.png</code><span class=""> 传上去，点提交。</span></p></li></ol><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><em><span class="">(如果你不用电脑，也可以直接在手机上长按下面这张图保存，然后通过 GitHub 网页版上传。)</span></em></p><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">（由于我没法直接把文件塞进你的电脑，请你在电脑上新建一个文本文档，把下面这段代码粘进去，保存为 </span><code>story.html</code><span class="">，双击打开它，你就能看到那个图标，然后右键另存为 </span><code>story.png</code><span class=""> 即可）：</span></p><div class="md-code-block md-code-block-light"><div class="md-code-block-banner-wrap"><div class="md-code-block-banner md-code-block-banner-lite"><div class="_121d384"><div class="d2a24f03"><span class="d813de27">html</span></div><div class="d2a24f03 _246a029"><div class="efa13877"><div role="button" class="ds-button ds-button--borderlessNeutral ds-button--borderless ds-button--capsule ds-button--xs ds-button--icon-relative-m ds-button--min-width _64bb515" tabindex="0"><div class="ds-button__background"></div><div class="ds-button__icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M6.14929 4.02032C7.11197 4.02032 7.87983 4.02016 8.49597 4.07598C9.12128 4.13269 9.65792 4.25188 10.1415 4.53106C10.7202 4.8653 11.2008 5.3459 11.535 5.92462C11.8142 6.40818 11.9334 6.94481 11.9901 7.57012C12.0459 8.18625 12.0458 8.95419 12.0458 9.9168C12.0458 10.8795 12.0459 11.6473 11.9901 12.2635C11.9334 12.8888 11.8142 13.4254 11.535 13.909C11.2008 14.4877 10.7202 14.9683 10.1415 15.3025C9.65792 15.5817 9.12128 15.7009 8.49597 15.7576C7.87984 15.8134 7.11196 15.8133 6.14929 15.8133C5.18667 15.8133 4.41874 15.8134 3.80261 15.7576C3.1773 15.7009 2.64067 15.5817 2.1571 15.3025C1.5784 14.9683 1.09778 14.4877 0.76355 13.909C0.484366 13.4254 0.365184 12.8888 0.308472 12.2635C0.252649 11.6473 0.252808 10.8795 0.252808 9.9168C0.252808 8.95418 0.252664 8.18625 0.308472 7.57012C0.365184 6.94481 0.484366 6.40818 0.76355 5.92462C1.09777 5.34589 1.57839 4.86529 2.1571 4.53106C2.64067 4.25188 3.1773 4.13269 3.80261 4.07598C4.41874 4.02017 5.18666 4.02032 6.14929 4.02032ZM6.14929 5.37774C5.16181 5.37774 4.46634 5.37761 3.92566 5.42657C3.39434 5.47472 3.07859 5.56574 2.83582 5.70587C2.4632 5.92106 2.15354 6.2307 1.93835 6.60333C1.79823 6.8461 1.70721 7.16185 1.65906 7.69317C1.6101 8.23385 1.61023 8.92933 1.61023 9.9168C1.61023 10.9043 1.61009 11.5998 1.65906 12.1404C1.70721 12.6717 1.79823 12.9875 1.93835 13.2303C2.15356 13.6029 2.46321 13.9126 2.83582 14.1277C3.07859 14.2679 3.39434 14.3589 3.92566 14.407C4.46634 14.456 5.16182 14.4559 6.14929 14.4559C7.13682 14.4559 7.83224 14.456 8.37292 14.407C8.90425 14.3589 9.21999 14.2679 9.46277 14.1277C9.83535 13.9126 10.145 13.6029 10.3602 13.2303C10.5004 12.9875 10.5914 12.6717 10.6395 12.1404C10.6885 11.5998 10.6884 10.9043 10.6884 9.9168C10.6884 8.92934 10.6885 8.23384 10.6395 7.69317C10.5914 7.16185 10.5004 6.8461 10.3602 6.60333C10.145